@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-01
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-01 v2. SysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed
' Approved figlib candidate v2 mapped to controlled ids. Not a proof of equivalence.
rectangle FS
' group FS: Msess / verification session domain
rectangle FP
' group FP: Mprot / protocol domain
component Operator
' entity Operator: Operator
component Session
' entity Session: CL-TAV session / candidate set H, resource state; / one admitted action per round
component TestAdapter
' entity TestAdapter: Test adapter / encodes stimuli; / captures raw records
component IUT
' entity IUT: IUT / loader target; protocol / messages and operation / states live here
component CLK
' entity CLK: Network clock / timestamps, error bound ε
component IB
' entity IB: 645 integrity boundary / identity bound; capability / NOT-ESTABLISHED
Operator --> Session : request test request
Session --> TestAdapter : e2 action a_k
TestAdapter --> Session : e3 obs. I_k
TestAdapter --> IUT : e4 stimulus
IUT --> TestAdapter : e5 raw records
TestAdapter --> CLK : e6 t_k ± ε
IUT ..> IB : e7 call and state only; / not algorithm evidence
note as NT
  Msess sees protocol state only
  through the adapter.
end note
note as legend
  Legend: information flow; non-evidential dependency
end note
@enduml
